class Runtime {
  <<frozen dataclass>>
  +Path workspace
  +Path skill_root
  +path(relative) Path
  +resource(relative) Path
  +output_root Path
  +check_output_path(path)
  +prepare()
}
class Session {
  +str session_id
  +str expires_at
  +float deadline
  +Draft_or_None draft
  +ConfirmationReceipt_or_None receipt
  -SessionPhase _phase
  -Lock _state_lock
  +Event terminal_event
  +upload(kind, name, source, size)
  +check_hotwords(rows)
  +validate(payload)
  +preview_ready(validation_id)
  +edit(validation_id)
  +confirm() ConfirmationReceipt
  +cancel() SessionTerminal
  +expire() SessionTerminal_or_None
  +terminal_result()
  +description()
  +cleanup()
}
class ThreadingHTTPServer
class LocalServer {
  +Session session
  +serve_forever(poll_interval)
  +expire_session()
  +server_bind()
  +server_close()
}
class DirectoryPicker {
  +select(initial, request_id) Path_or_None
  +cancel(request_id)
  +close()
}
Session --> Runtime : 工作目录与资源边界
Session "1" *-- "1" DirectoryPicker : 创建并关闭窗口
ThreadingHTTPServer <|-- LocalServer
LocalServer "1" *-- "1" Session : 单次编辑生命周期
note for Session "application/session.py<br/>状态锁保护预览、交接、取消与到期<br/>预览只存转写设置，成功交接才创建job_id<br/>有效期从创建起两小时，操作不续期<br/>确认与回执失败边界以实际磁盘状态为准"
note for LocalServer "web.py<br/>create_server绑定127.0.0.1并保存私有连接信息<br/>一次Timer触发expire；SSE发送终态<br/>server_close清理Session、移除连接凭据<br/>基类等待非daemon请求线程完成自身清理"
note for Runtime "utils/environment.py<br/>resource读取Skill；path定位workspace/.asr-transcription<br/>私有运行目录与Skill互不包含；保护Skill写入边界"
note for DirectoryPicker "utils/directory_picker.py<br/>目录窗口独立子进程；按请求编号取消<br/>Session登记用户选择的精确输出目录"
